<newsitem itemid="250743" id="root" date="1996-12-11" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: Tung wins Hong Kong leadership race.</title>
<headline>Tung wins Hong Kong leadership race.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping magnate Tung Chee-hwa won a historic vote on Wednesday to become Hong Kong's first Chinese leader when a century and a half of British rule ends in 1997.</p>
</text>
